        "original_id": "8df84a49-693e-55de-8c6a-d8603f832694",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jordan Mintz\n- Companies: Enron Corporation, Arthur Andersen\n- Events: Enron scandal\n- Roles: Managing Director for Corporate Tax\n- Places: Houston, Texas\n\nFacts:\n- Jordan Mintz was a whistleblower at Enron Corporation and formerly served as Enron Corporation's Managing Director for Corporate Tax.\n- The Enron scandal was publicized in October 2001.\n- Enron Corporation was an American energy company based in Houston, Texas.\n- The Enron scandal eventually led to the bankruptcy of Enron Corporation.\n- The Enron scandal also led to the de facto dissolution of Arthur Andersen, which had been one of the five largest audit and accountancy partnerships in the world.",
